      "title": "Dell Technologies vs. NVIDIA: Which Artificial Intelligence Stock Is a Better Buy in 2026?",
      "summary": "Dell Technologies and NVIDIA represent different plays on the AI boom. Dell has surged over 200% in 2026 with strong server sales driven by AI adoption, while NVIDIA remains the dominant chip leader with superior financials and a 55.6% net margin. Though Dell appears cheaper on valuation metrics, NVIDIA is recommended as the better long-term investment due to its market leadership, CUDA software dominance, and stronger balance sheet.",
